# STAFFLBL.LBL -- interoffice mail labels for STAFF.DBF, three across
# (Using InitechBase, LABEL).  The 1034-byte label form of dBASE III PLUS
# (dbase3-decomp specs/file-formats/lbl.md): 3 lines a label, 24 characters
# wide, no left margin, 1 line and 2 spaces between labels, 3 across.  The
# expressions of a line are separated by commas; each value is printed
# without its trailing blanks, one space after the one before.
LABEL STAFFLBL.LBL
REMARKS Interoffice mail, 3 across
SIZE 3 24 0 1 2 3
LINE TRIM(FIRSTNAME),LASTNAME
LINE "Ext.",EXT
LINE "Dept.",DEPT
